      en: ["Location: Adjacent to Lake Tengrela near Banfora", "Vegetation type: Sudan-Guinean woodland savanna", "Key flora: Notable for kapok trees (Ceiba pentandra)", "Ecology: Acts as a buffer against lake erosion", "Wildlife: Habitat for Western Colobus monkeys", "Cultural value: Site for local traditional ceremonies"],
