      en: ["Area: approx. 150 km² (58 sq miles)", "Status: Forest reserve since 1955", "Wildlife: Sanctuary for 50-100 elephants", "Rainfall: Average 1,100 mm (43 inches) per year", "Flora: Sudanian forest with mahogany and shea trees", "Hydrography: Part of the Comoé River basin"],
